</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 697)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Quitting now asks about all your unsaved work.</b> After a save, notes you typed, marks you drew, grade changes and session notes were not counted as changes &#8212; so quitting didn&#8217;t ask, and they were lost. &#8220;Save changes?&#8221; now appears for every one of them, and still doesn&#8217;t appear when you have only moved around or played.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
